I wanted to add one other note to this comment.  (The comment is not to
be attributed to its author, he was presenting his analysis of other people's
philosophies.)

Of these two sentences, the first is true and the second is not, so this
as a whole is not correct in my judgement.

To call a newsgroup just a name, just a tag is to miss the entire point
of the online revolution that we have built here, and in other places, this
last decade.

