even designed a proposed net around it.  But it's missing the forest for
the trees.  A newsgroup is not just its topic area, or even just the
sum of its messages.

If you don't see that forest, then you won't understand those of us who
talk about a newgroup going bad and needing to be cleaned up, or not being
safe to carry until it gets cleaned up.

