Yes it is.  The issue at hand is that there are groups which serve as
organized points of distribution for posted material which is in the main
pirated copies of pictures which appeared in print form.

>Are you one of the people who believes that posting scans of Playboy
>Bunnies, without explicit permission, is analogous to armed robbery?

I am of the belief that theft is theft.  It certainly is robbery; not
<armed> robbery, but robbery, yes.

>]Is it right or wrong to make copies of material which you do not own and
>]that which the owner normally charges money for distribution -- and post 
