I disagree.  Again, breaking into computer systems <and stealing documents
from them> is, at least from my point of view, a piracy issue.  

I suspect that if it was your software or document that was stolen you'd
feel the same way.

>   >>Contrary to earlier suggestions, none of the alleged offenses in any
>   >>of the above cases were net-related. 
> 
